 <h3><u>Goonje saare aalam me</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya husain ya husain ya husain..(4)<br> Goonje saare aalam me..(2)<br> allah kare bus hi kalaam<br> salaam salaam<br> salaaam munjhe sabir husain maula salaam..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Maula haider ja hubdaro<br> maula husain ja matamdaro<br> sain zainab ja pursa daro<br> subha shaam hado hi naaro<br> gunje saare aalam me...</p> 
  <p>2. Majlis, matam, girya zaari<br> alam, sabeelu taziyadari<br> singa rey maula ji sawari<br> sog manaye duniya saari<br> gunje saare aalam me...</p> 
  <p>3. Ghum sa dil abaad ka nokar<br> karbobala khe yaad ka nokar<br> har kam in kha baad ka nokar<br> teher yahi faryaad ka nokar<br> gunje saare aalam me...</p> 
  <p>4. Je siyahe seene me dum<br> kara nowa shabbira jo matam<br> aahe dua lehrae hardam<br> har ghara de abbas jo parcham<br> gunje saare aalam me...</p> 
  <p>5. Yasrab thi veeran chave tho<br> karbala jo maidan chave tho<br> shaamwaro zindaan chave tho<br> ratt roi qur'an chave tho<br> gunje saare aalam me...</p> 
  <p>6. Naize jo haswaar na gusre<br> qaide pardadaar na gusre<br> shaam wali bazaar na gusre<br> fasiqa ji darbaar na gusre<br> gunje saare aalam me...</p> 
  <p>7. Jawwad o irfan dua aa<br> ghot bitaiya ji mansha aa<br> nooraniya jiwiya nida aa<br> sehwaniya jiwiya sadaa<br> gunje saare aalam me...</p> 
